For further context, see the [Euclidean parametrization of Pythagorean triples](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pythagorean_triple#Generating_a_triple) and [discrete convex analysis](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Discrete_convex_analysis).
